    "chunk_text": "AU13A6 \u00d0a het Ualerianus, Decies prafest \u00fe\u00e6s caseres, gebindan \u00f0ysne Ypolitum on wildu hors AU13A8 Ond \u00fea geb\u00e6d he him to drihtne ond onsende his gast, ond \u00f0a hors forleton \u00f0one lichoman. AU13A10 Ond \u00fea ymbe medmicelne fyrst \u00e6fter \u00feam swealt Valerianus se prauost, ond \u00e6r\u00fean he AU13A14 Ond Decius se kasere awedde. AU13A15 Ond he clypode \u00e6r he swulte, eala, Yppolitus, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0u me grimlice l\u00e6dest gebundenne in AU13B1 On \u00f0one ylcan d\u00e6g by\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6s martyres tid sancti Casiani, se wes lareow geongra manna in AU13B3 Ac \u00fea com \u00fe\u00e6r sum h\u00e6\u00feen kasere, \u00fea alyfde se \u00feam cnihtum \u00fe\u00e6t hi hyne ofslogen mid AU13B6 Ond his \u00ferowung w\u00e6s \u00fee lengre ond \u00fey heardre \u00fey \u00fee hyra handa w\u00e6ron unstrange hine to AU15A1 On \u00feone XVan d\u00e6g \u00fe\u00e6s mon\u00feys bi\u00fe seo tid \u00fe\u00e6t is sancta Marian tid. AU15A2 On \u00feone d\u00e6g heo geleorde of middangearde to Criste, ond heo nu scine\u00fe on \u00feam AU15A6 Englas \u00fe\u00e6r blissia\u00fe, ond heahenglas \u00fe\u00e6r wynsumia\u00fe, ond ealle \u00fea halgan \u00fe\u00e6r gefeo\u00fe in AU15A8 Sancta Maria w\u00e6s on lxiiiium geara \u00fea \u00f0a heo ferde to Criste; Sancta Maria is godf\u00e6der AU15A13 Seo stonde\u00fe on \u00fea swy\u00feran healfe \u00f0\u00e6s heahf\u00e6der ond \u00f0\u00e6s heahkyninges. AU17A1 On \ufffd",
